body:
I have the following config:

``` js
var search = instantsearch({
            appId: algolia.application_ID,
            apiKey: algolia.search_API_key,
            indexName: algolia.default_search_index,
            urlSync: {
                mapping: {'q': 's'},
                trackedParameters: ['query']
            },

            searchParameters: {
                distinct: '1'
            }
        });
```

I want to only have the `query` tracked in the url as `s`.
A weird `is_v` parameter gets also append even if it is not part of the `trackedParameters` list.
